      "text": "working_ids = encode(decode(working_ids) + prefix)\n\n\u2022 Byte-level BPE is context-sensitive: boundary\n  characters merge differently depending on neighbors\n  (e.g., leading space '\u0120' tokens).\n\u2022 Concatenating raw token IDs of injected JSON\n  punctuation creates non-canonical sequences the\n  model never saw in training, degrading logits.\n\u2022 Re-encoding the full string keeps token boundaries\n  100% canonical at every step.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "working_ids = encode(decode(working_ids) + prefix)\n\n\u2022 Byte-level BPE is context-sensitive: boundary\n  characters merge differently depending on neighbors\n  (e.g., leading space '\u0120' tokens).\n\u2022 Concatenating raw token IDs of injected JSON\n  punctuation creates non-canonical sequences the\n  model never saw in training, degrading logits.\n\u2022 Re-encoding the full string keeps token boundaries\n  100% canonical at every step.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
