      "text": "\u2022 Missing / Corrupt Files: FileNotFoundError and\n  json.JSONDecodeError caught cleanly in __main__.py\n  and registry.py (no raw tracebacks).\n\u2022 Empty Registry: select_function_name raises\n  ValueError; caught per-prompt in batch loop.\n\u2022 Empty Prompt: build_prompt raises ValueError.\n\u2022 Number Fallback: ValueError on float/int parse\n  defaults safely to 0 or 0.0.\n\u2022 No KV-Cache Exposed: Skipping model calls on\n  static JSON syntax keeps forward passes < 40/call.",
